<BaseLayout title="Terms & conditions | Zion Creative" description="Terms & conditions for Zion Creative."><Header/><main id="main" class="container policy-page"><h1>Terms & conditions</h1><p>Zion Creative is based in Springfield, Illinois. For website, privacy, or accessibility questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@zioncreative.co">hello@zioncreative.co</a> or <a href="tel:+12177252031">217.725.2031</a>.</p><h2>About this website</h2><p>This website presents creative work and information about services. Descriptions and examples are for general information. A website inquiry does not itself confirm a booking or create a project agreement.</p><h2>Project agreements</h2><p>Project scope, deliverables, fees, timelines, licenses, cancellation, and refund arrangements belong in the proposal or agreement for the specific engagement. Please request and review those details before committing to a project. Past project examples are not a guarantee of future business results.</p><h2>Creative work and third-party content</h2><p>Case studies may include client brands, photographs, websites, and work created with collaborators. Display on this website does not grant visitors a license to copy or reuse those materials. Relevant ownership and permissions depend on the work and its rights holders. Contact <a href="mailto:hello@zioncreative.co">hello@zioncreative.co</a> or <a href="tel:+12177252031">217.725.2031</a> about permission requests, credits, or copyright concerns.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>External websites and optional embedded services have their own terms and privacy notices. See the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> and <a href="/cookies">cookies policy</a> before using them.</p><h2>Questions and accessibility</h2><p>If a page or form is difficult to use, contact <a href="mailto:hello@zioncreative.co">hello@zioncreative.co</a> or <a href="tel:+12177252031">217.725.2031</a> with the page and a description of the problem so another way to communicate can be